  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to plants classified VAI 414 days before and 146 days after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows somatropin has been posted since 2023-01-06 and as of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on the list for 46 months.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1167028 at Novo Nordisk A/S - KV ended 2021-11-18 classified VAI, 414 days before the shortage posting on 2023-01-06.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1238387 at Novo Nordisk A/S - Hax ended 2023-06-01 classified VAI, 146 days after the shortage posting on 2023-01-06.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1341150 at Novo Nordisk A/S - KV ended 2024-05-02 classified VAI, 482 days after the shortage posting on 2023-01-06.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Novo Nordisk, Inc. is listed as To Be Discontinued with initial posting date 2025-11-14 and related info stating discontinuation of manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds two NDCs for somatropin: Eli Lilly NDC 00002814701 with 69.91 units on hand and Novo Nordisk NDC 00169770321 with 64.42 units on hand.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to transfer 13 units from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would bring Corvale East to 7 days on hand while Corvale General retains two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    }
  ]
}
